    <informations>Shelly 2PM Gen4 — mounting view.
Terminals, left to right as printed: O1 L L O2 S1 S2 N.

Official sources:
https://kb.shelly.cloud/knowledge-base/shelly-2pm-gen4
https://kb.shelly.cloud/__attachments/a_7538dbbce6e0f8f8834406858acd45920cc9e54f429d73d223aeb25994e59a9c/Shelly%202PM%20Gen4.jpg?cb=ab1fdbb8c8ea3cce8e11bd6a7b95217d
